  "_doc": "Map 4's main egg (UPDATE 07, docs/MAP4_FERNFLUG.md §9.1; T-114): one quest spanning the four acts. Each step carries the act it lives on (`act`); a skip to a later act marks earlier acts' steps done, a campaign arrival carries the real progress (Campaign.snapshot 'quests'). Acts I and II here; Acts III and IV follow their builds. No hidden hard-fails: every step is retryable, every step has a dev skip and a bot_task. T-115 adds the Act III group (s11a Dee's radio, s11b the core carry and Peg's choice (any of peg_resigned / peg_delivered), s12 the Lodestone build, s12b Fasbender's burn, s13 the Test Pilot caught once by a lift, s14 the console → rocket_ready) and the Act IV group (s15a the yard airlock, s15 the three columns read (all dark), s16a the crew's tags (optional), s16 the Account opens, s17 the Manager escalates, s18 CANCEL). Flag steps may name `any`, `all` or `zone` (QuestManager.flag_step_satisfied).",
